@startuml isProfileExistsAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
isProfileExistsAsync – Check if Profile Exists
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Profile" as profColl #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
               profile UUID 
end note

requestor -> profColl: (profileUuid)
activate profColl

profColl -> jd: read profile-collection
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> profColl: full profile-collection
deactivate jd

note over profColl
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Extract profiles from profile-collection  
  - Check if any profile's UUID matches input  
  - Return true if found, false otherwise
end note

profColl --> requestor: Boolean (true / false)
deactivate profColl

@enduml
